Fizz buzz.

The call for a number (a whole number) is text:
"FizzBuzz" if the remainder of the number divided by 15 is 0,
"Fizz" if the remainder of the number divided by 3 is 0,
"Buzz" if the remainder of the number divided by 5 is 0,
otherwise the number as text.

For example, the call for 9 is "Fizz".
For example, the call for 10 is "Buzz".
For example, the call for 30 is "FizzBuzz".
For example, the call for 7 is "7".
